         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nIn this class we are going to learn the multiplication table of nine (9).\n\nThis is the last multiplication table we are going to study. Nine is the last decimal number we study here: ten will appear in a special scenario, and the other numbers will be reached with tools that help us multiply.\n\nLet us follow this path and see how the table of nine grows.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
